    {
      "id": "f9cfec70-6592-4b6a-a639-1e8f72bf24d0",
      "title": "Escute a frase e observe a moldura de conselho antes do verbo.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "3c094249-ccaf-4373-ade9-98949474849c",
          "textContent": "<p>Escute e observe o conselho.</p><p><strong>Yo que tú, probaría el disco en vivo.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Se eu fosse você, experimentaria o disco ao vivo.</strong></p><p>A mesma ideia também aparece em <strong>En tu lugar...</strong>. Depois dessas molduras, o verbo costuma ir no condicional: <strong>probaría</strong>, <strong>escucharía</strong>, <strong>empezaría</strong>.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/7727b225d91a462db3645c4dc7d205cd_b05-yo-que-tu-probaria-el-disco-en-vivo.mp3?Expires=1794099590&Signature=tW13aqodH-DsxwU9Ocmqf32fFCJpVqCyGy7a3sSNH57L~AlvI0tCRMPQnVMp8qiKsC-Tprcmd9Nhig8K~sl4XZxhFcT~uyPbT2XXfkA3t0ky552jAcMZgxAF7SNWbTLKJopJfG0zsKSa2X6ceMUCjySa12sdhOyf6rKk3atiijlQiJYiP-eF8uuET2EnKU4el7wtmPOA3Qn80u~z5b-sX1j0D3Eh-j47Ysn3bCzOF2xNViWi6nXPMlTUXhbxo-sfKLG6Lhpq5qMcX02xGboIM148-UmCywQIRn2sWdSWk8NJw~NakC2Wg-gId0oQxG45Iel~FCTJ~PEcfLrfMmiXyA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
