          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Te recomiendo la playlist Ruta de noche.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Eu te recomendo a playlist Ruta de noche.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/5fe44187ed0645999fb80ebecbe86f6c_b06-dlg-02-te-recomiendo-ruta-de-noche.mp3?Expires=1794099590&Signature=ykgCFKInsuZj9f4KuTrFZWFGI0e27tB2Vue68o3E2n0eFmJvgVOox0e6akDli943mubf2l-hf35aC6wZAaHXrLxpj-wBv~wfPORtr5daUVFFOMYO~0pwVI1LJWUb24kKh9B8EidJWecLxmVqfeN7FLLkj8ZuSfANYBgGfpcAkjFwUiX9a44wC3mcQ4Hi9-ATvgA25hTbibK6GPn65GUFFlyJvw9LFkPPuT~Mx1JGv-sMS6QwoUbrc6nMQNeXrpm104cbsPayMmnNI46RlNvHU1NVuBxhxI1dMT0Q9JBZ0Ch8THIQsReIQU04q5DF6Kw2ClgRM85KdAUuEFcX4tLr8g__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Suena bien, pero prefiero voces suaves.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Parece bom, mas eu prefiro vozes suaves.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/966b996ccefe47af8326438befad8f51_b06-dlg-03-prefiero-voces-suaves.mp3?Expires=1794099590&Signature=g7-beVyWgXKs0GRcdyHjx2WLMbea37fF4ybG0NUk8nKsosd-tJY-bRIc-4xVApP~cuwzG-n6ZF9h7MJAOOYGBKWgW7UYKDzelXcyjGHTJWuFWfvKCIxzbb-krlzsvaQvVRl93xap0IO1otNktuwES2p3ZPu7jVBFxfi-vT8WkhAton7AyfZ9I1l0e~indHD3Zu6tY1ef67SKc3u-ECav7FnCj01ItmODf6JGWGv0zTHtkhbIch6QP9ort7cXcfxC2NdvbRISOqLtRuaVVqsvHYSsoXQ605CsG4linW~xUoSdUu0N3nrZdYpMpP2WuPbmZn4Z6BCJomY9zVlPZQ6Jmg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Entonces deberías escuchar a Vera Luz. Yo que tú, empezaría por su último disco.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Então você deveria ouvir Vera Luz. Se eu fosse você, começaria pelo último disco dela.</div>\n</div>",
