    {
      "id": "9228d3ac-f330-494a-a327-cb2280eeecd7",
      "title": "Passe pelo resumo e conecte cada moldura a um momento comum: estudo, volta para casa ou busca por algo menos comercial.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 7,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "bd2b978b-f5dc-448b-8e3b-cb31eb4c67c1",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Te recomiendo esta playlist para trabajar.</strong></p><p>Use <strong>te recomiendo</strong> quando você já sabe qual item faz sentido para aquela situacao.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/4c82e55b5ed246deba09f7fae229154d_b02-te-recomiendo-esta-playlist-para-trabajar.mp3?Expires=1794099590&Signature=YKZUlCxxX3ok5WhO3a9-RoM8rFWDvifOcYorgkrLRBQNNljOej2Zf3jQMePgzE0K8CcY9exK4UKpa6-Xt6JU1cWg02ITfRXEiuGHVkc~TkQLWbNWSZTpHY9EqA99fsPjCN4QKCDaFHjjV0d2NJtLKuUbAdLaukSaLwCoa8x0G-cUuQrOFAp8sZvWEEP2o7DINQmC~ajiW8d2uUW7ILcQjOpvY2BcodwMuwp3VxRkfHVqy~8sVbSfPjA3B5WYnLcnyE-RPyo-KwHaYKoq6S~j~JQqY8zD46ENCvzlWkxaReQaw84fX46k1GHJsoxqcb95q0EC-2x64Xlr33E1krnupg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
