          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/4c4d013c6a5a4384b60dbd04bf7b6cc6_b04-deberias-escuchar-a-vera-luz.mp3?Expires=1794099590&Signature=yLDMUHvgCroMLOlA4PaJ1BrUav4Zpo62K1bgtWNhcWcY7HhviF9eZw~pkz0QwFkGGjupjVdgAKZk9qxe2tWC7KzpssBCz4IOxThoc7uklFb7cnjKmFSRDxU5MDaGNmw-Ma--xuqlejFINlCGm6JUJSMBipsmLiWrobC2rtH1ucYDQzf2ofFNwLaT0lT5bMeDfcGlScUXPbT9T7vMxdzQhVMCjEMV~P~h-ZNNWd5PevB1kxCR~KWoE01hWAteZaWMHu4QqxpqmzSeJVXFWnV6ErP4Fd1ivuBLa29R-ZMaC1HNKZyo9y8Y8Nq4qR4SI26NszukL1CKsi~jhsGn5esKaQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
